WEBVTT

00:00:17.225 --> 00:00:21.062
Diastrophism is happening
increasingly all around the globe!

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:27.235
Mythic Aquarion's seal being broken
is influencing the entire world.

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.697
Amata and the others'
whereabouts are still unknown!

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.825
We have no choice but to go to Altair
with the reserve machines to get it back!

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.787
But how?! Unless the
dimensional gate is opened...

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.498
I'll open a hole in the dimension!

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:44.878
I know it's a power born by accident,
and I had help from Shrade, too...

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.173
But still, I was able to make it happen once!

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.674
Can you do it?!

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:54.054
If I don't do it now, just what have I
been digging holes for all this time?!

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.181
Let me go! Director!

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:03.438
Andy W. Hall... I'll bet
everything on your power!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.045
So you stand in my way, Solar Wing?!

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:36.554
Our goal is to secure the true Eve!

00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:40.308
Avoid attacking the core unit directly.
Just neutralize its attack capabilities!

00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:49.067
Damn Izumo! How dare he mock me?!

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.964
So this is the power of Solar Wing...

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.465
But...

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:15.218
...it's nothing!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:22.183
Power strong enough to annihilate
the Gnis unit in an instant...!

00:02:22.183 --> 00:02:24.060
I'll return it two-fold!

00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:27.689
Returning two-fold!

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:29.691
Then I'll reverse it!

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:36.656
The power of Reversal...

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.992
My return blast is being offset!

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:42.412
Izumo! I'm not gonna let you have my
damn woman, even if it costs me my life!

00:02:42.412 --> 00:02:44.205
Why, Kagura?!

00:02:44.205 --> 00:02:46.958
Why are you so obsessed with that Rare Igura?!

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:50.503
That's because this damn
woman belongs only to me!

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.630
What a childish thing to say!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:55.967
Sir Izumo, I'll back you up!

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.138
That Abductor...

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:03.350
Mix! Oh, no...!

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.522
Altair's future lies with Sir Izumo.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.236
Everyone... please return safely.

00:03:27.123 --> 00:03:30.251
It's been a while since the
last time just us guys merged!

00:03:30.251 --> 00:03:32.379
We're about to reach the destination point!

00:03:32.379 --> 00:03:35.465
Let's hurry! Guys only! Satsubatsu Gattai!

00:03:35.465 --> 00:03:37.801
We're not gonna do such a Gattai!

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:40.512
With hot blood...! Masurao Gattai!

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:43.473
--Go!
--Aquarion!

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:51.856
Aquarion Gepart!

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:04.035
Mix...

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:09.374
No matter what state your body is in,
I'll come and get you for sure!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.046
I told you this before, right, Mix?!

00:04:15.046 --> 00:04:20.260
Holes... Holes are made in
order to connect the world.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.472
I'll connect this world to the world
where you are now for sure!

00:04:24.472 --> 00:04:28.810
And I'll make a big hole in your heart, too!

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:32.272
A huge hole that I myself will fill!

00:04:53.585 --> 00:04:55.670
A quasi-dimensional gate has appeared!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.173
Go! Guys!

00:05:07.057 --> 00:05:10.518
Just wait, Mix!

00:05:11.853 --> 00:05:14.981
Someone... called my name just now!

00:05:16.483 --> 00:05:19.694
No! My name is Mixy!

00:05:24.366 --> 00:05:26.368
Take that!

00:05:26.368 --> 00:05:27.494
You bastard!

00:05:27.494 --> 00:05:28.787
Stop it!

00:05:28.787 --> 00:05:32.540
The one piloting it is Mix! She's my friend!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.084
Your friend?

00:05:34.084 --> 00:05:35.585
He's coming.

00:05:41.049 --> 00:05:43.301
Tsk. That Damn Izumo...

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:46.346
Amata...!

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:58.483
Amata...

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.361
Amata...

00:06:02.779 --> 00:06:04.280
Who is it?!

00:06:05.824 --> 00:06:07.325
Amata...

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.161
Amata...!

00:06:18.712 --> 00:06:20.672
Where am I?

00:06:20.672 --> 00:06:22.173
Amata...

00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:34.686
You bastard!

00:06:37.105 --> 00:06:38.982
Reverse!

00:06:38.982 --> 00:06:40.483
Sir Izumo!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.404
Fly head over heels!

00:06:49.576 --> 00:06:50.952
I'm gonna kill you!

00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:52.454
Stop it!

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:59.336
That machine is...

00:06:59.336 --> 00:07:00.378
You are...

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:02.255
Aquarion Gepart!

00:07:02.255 --> 00:07:04.549
To think that we jumped right into a battle!

00:07:04.549 --> 00:07:08.219
Two Abductors and the
Mythic Aquarion. Who's operating it?

00:07:08.219 --> 00:07:10.347
Cayenne?! Is that you, Cayenne?!

00:07:10.347 --> 00:07:13.224
Mikono! What are you doing with that guy?!

00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:14.893
Mix!

00:07:14.893 --> 00:07:17.103
That's Mix's machine!

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:19.898
What the heck is going on?!

00:07:19.898 --> 00:07:23.193
Those two Abductors are after Mikono!

00:07:23.193 --> 00:07:25.111
What happened to Amata and Shrade?!

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:27.447
I got separated from Amata.

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:30.158
Shrade died...

00:07:31.409 --> 00:07:35.080
...while playing his last opus
in the gap between dimensions.

00:07:37.624 --> 00:07:40.377
So, as I suspected...

00:07:54.391 --> 00:07:56.017
Shrade...

00:07:57.977 --> 00:08:00.438
Are you trying to get in Sir Izumo's way, too?!

00:08:00.438 --> 00:08:04.442
What're you saying, Mix?!
I just want to get you back, that's all!

00:08:04.442 --> 00:08:05.694
Get me back?!

00:08:05.694 --> 00:08:10.699
Try to remember, Mix!
Try to remember me, Andy W. Hall!

00:08:14.452 --> 00:08:16.746
Your words are annoying!

00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:18.373
Mix!

00:08:22.585 --> 00:08:24.838
Look at the big picture, Kagura!

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:27.215
Don't you want to save Altair?!

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:29.384
I don't give a damn!

00:08:29.384 --> 00:08:31.469
This planet's future doesn't matter to me!

00:08:31.469 --> 00:08:34.180
If I have my damn woman,
that's all I care about!

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.726
Even if I end up making
enemies of the entire world,

00:08:37.726 --> 00:08:40.645
I won't let my damn woman go!

00:08:40.645 --> 00:08:43.148
Mix! Mix!

00:08:44.607 --> 00:08:48.528
For just one Igura... One woman...

00:08:51.322 --> 00:08:52.824
Alicia...

00:09:00.999 --> 00:09:03.668
The voice that's calling me...

00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:05.754
Is it coming from there?

00:09:05.754 --> 00:09:07.255
Amata...

00:09:29.861 --> 00:09:32.572
Mom...

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:34.074
Amata...

00:09:40.288 --> 00:09:43.875
The stars, the earth, and the life
that had been slumbering...

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:47.712
All of them are about to awaken.

00:09:49.172 --> 00:09:53.968
The revival of Solar Wing
is a double-edged sword.

00:09:53.968 --> 00:09:57.764
Will the power it holds be the
power to separate the worlds...

00:09:57.764 --> 00:10:00.767
...or the power to connect the worlds?

00:10:09.651 --> 00:10:11.820
Come back, Mix!

00:10:13.571 --> 00:10:15.323
Spatial Augmentation!

00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:17.992
Again?!

00:10:17.992 --> 00:10:20.328
We've been doing this over
and over for a while now!

00:10:20.328 --> 00:10:22.163
I'll do it as many times as needed...

00:10:22.163 --> 00:10:24.582
...until I hold her in my arms!

00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:27.502
I make holes and she fills them!

00:10:27.502 --> 00:10:31.339
That's how we came to understand each other!

00:10:39.097 --> 00:10:43.643
Why?! Repeating these unproductive
actions somehow feels like...

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:45.645
...it brings back memories.

00:10:47.856 --> 00:10:50.483
Amata...

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:52.277
I was finally able to see you...

00:10:54.279 --> 00:10:56.114
You've grown...

00:10:59.284 --> 00:11:01.036
Suddenly you care?!

00:11:01.036 --> 00:11:03.913
You took off and left me behind!

00:11:03.913 --> 00:11:07.792
Do you even understand how
I've been feeling all this time?!

00:11:07.792 --> 00:11:11.713
And after all this time... now you call me!

00:11:14.049 --> 00:11:15.550
Amata...

00:11:19.054 --> 00:11:21.765
I won't even ask you to forgive me.

00:11:21.765 --> 00:11:24.642
But please... I want you to know...

00:11:26.603 --> 00:11:29.064
...the reason why I left you behind...

00:11:30.523 --> 00:11:33.651
...and about your father.

00:11:36.321 --> 00:11:39.032
Your father isn't from Earth.

00:11:40.408 --> 00:11:42.911
Izumo Kamurogi...

00:11:42.911 --> 00:11:45.080
He's the top leader of Altair.

00:11:50.001 --> 00:11:51.795
That man is...

00:11:57.175 --> 00:12:03.890
If I am to end the curse of Eve and
the tragedies surrounding Rare Iguras,

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:06.434
I cannot afford to lose!

00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:12.357
Your father came to Earth with the mission
of bringing back women who could endure

00:12:12.357 --> 00:12:14.359
the dimensional transposition.

00:12:16.194 --> 00:12:18.905
It was back when I was still an actress.

00:13:09.956 --> 00:13:13.626
When I made an emergency landing
on Vega due to system trouble,

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:15.754
she was the one who saved me.

00:13:17.047 --> 00:13:20.717
It didn't take long before I realized that Alicia

00:13:20.717 --> 00:13:22.927
was the Rare Igura we had been seeking.

00:13:24.095 --> 00:13:25.597
However...

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.686
Even before that happened...

00:13:33.605 --> 00:13:35.857
...we started being drawn to each other.

00:13:47.619 --> 00:13:50.789
I can't laugh at Kagura.

00:13:50.789 --> 00:13:56.252
Once, I almost betrayed
Altair for a single woman.

00:13:57.671 --> 00:14:03.468
Without telling the top brass
about her, I came back to Altair.

00:14:03.468 --> 00:14:05.095
However...

00:14:05.095 --> 00:14:07.806
...I could not fool Mykage.

00:14:15.855 --> 00:14:22.529
When he showed up again a few
years later, I already had you.

00:14:23.655 --> 00:14:29.244
But when he told me about the curse of Eve, I...

00:14:30.745 --> 00:14:31.996
I'll come with you.

00:14:31.996 --> 00:14:33.373
Are you sure?

00:14:33.373 --> 00:14:37.836
We don't know how a
Rare Igura will be treated there.

00:14:37.836 --> 00:14:41.923
I don't care if I can be of help to you.

00:14:43.258 --> 00:14:44.801
Alicia...

00:14:51.766 --> 00:14:56.271
I debated with myself quite a bit over
whether or not I should take you with me.

00:14:56.271 --> 00:14:58.023
But...

00:14:58.023 --> 00:15:03.153
...I was afraid that taking you with me might
put you in danger on an unfamiliar planet.

00:15:04.696 --> 00:15:09.909
I never thought that we'd
be separated this long.

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:12.871
Well... no matter what excuses I come up with,

00:15:12.871 --> 00:15:15.874
the fact still remains that I abandoned you.

00:15:15.874 --> 00:15:19.377
I wanted to save the planet of my loved one...

00:15:19.377 --> 00:15:22.422
The things that my loved one loved...

00:15:34.142 --> 00:15:37.479
I've borne resentment against you all this time.

00:15:42.067 --> 00:15:44.736
But not anymore.

00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:49.407
The one I hate

00:15:49.407 --> 00:15:54.329
is my child self who could do
nothing but see you off back then.

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:57.082
The courage to go after the one you love...

00:15:57.082 --> 00:16:00.168
You had it, but I didn't.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.548
That's all it was... Mom.

00:16:06.925 --> 00:16:08.593
Amata...

00:16:23.608 --> 00:16:26.069
Enough is enough, Izumo!

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:28.154
I cannot be defeated!

00:16:28.154 --> 00:16:30.865
I won't let Alicia's sacrifice go to waste, either!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:34.869
The Mythic Aquarion is fighting!

00:16:34.869 --> 00:16:38.790
Izumo and your other half are there.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.375
Kagura is?!

00:16:42.043 --> 00:16:46.214
The Iron Sea that my mother Oriza created...!

00:17:01.855 --> 00:17:05.066
What're those red strings?!

00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:09.696
All the energy on Altair is being
concentrated into Afura Gnis?!

00:17:17.829 --> 00:17:19.622
Altair Cannon.

00:17:30.383 --> 00:17:31.885
Fire.

00:17:32.969 --> 00:17:34.471
What?!

00:17:45.815 --> 00:17:50.236
This light is the very power of Altair.

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:52.072
That damn Izumo...

00:17:56.534 --> 00:17:59.162
That was just a warning.

00:17:59.162 --> 00:18:04.125
Unless you hand over the true Eve,
I'll fire it at max power!

00:18:06.878 --> 00:18:08.755
Zessica?!

00:18:08.755 --> 00:18:10.256
What?

00:18:19.265 --> 00:18:20.767
That place is...!

00:18:27.732 --> 00:18:29.234
Mom!

00:18:33.988 --> 00:18:35.490
Mom...

00:18:39.744 --> 00:18:42.455
Kagura!

00:18:42.455 --> 00:18:44.249
Alicia!

00:18:45.333 --> 00:18:46.459
What's going on?

00:18:46.459 --> 00:18:48.086
Now is the chance.

00:18:52.257 --> 00:18:58.930
Take this! Genesis Mugen Punch!

00:19:08.648 --> 00:19:11.693
Goodbye, Izumo.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:31.463
This power... Mykage!

00:19:31.463 --> 00:19:33.923
Is this your doing?!

00:19:35.633 --> 00:19:37.135
What?!

00:19:42.599 --> 00:19:44.267
Silffy!

00:20:16.883 --> 00:20:18.760
Alicia...

00:20:20.512 --> 00:20:22.013
Hang in there!

00:20:30.146 --> 00:20:33.316
I saw Mom.

00:20:33.316 --> 00:20:35.860
She told me about you, too.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:37.529
I see...

00:20:43.618 --> 00:20:47.706
Take me... to Alicia.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:57.048
I can't even find the words
to ask for forgiveness.

00:20:57.048 --> 00:21:01.928
I took your mother... away from you.

00:21:07.475 --> 00:21:09.227
Those are...

00:21:09.227 --> 00:21:11.563
Mayflies...

00:21:11.563 --> 00:21:15.900
I only saw them once before,
when I was a child.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:21.239
They were supposed to have died out
long ago after the females disappeared.

00:21:21.239 --> 00:21:23.324
Why now...?

00:21:30.248 --> 00:21:33.626
This is Area 337...

00:21:33.626 --> 00:21:37.756
A place where we frequently
had troubles with the Iron Sea.

00:21:37.756 --> 00:21:41.718
Could it possibly be that
the Iron Sea itself was the...?

00:21:44.763 --> 00:21:49.559
The mother earth... Goddess of the earth...

00:21:49.559 --> 00:21:52.312
The earth, which brings a
blessed abundant harvest,

00:21:52.312 --> 00:21:55.440
symbolized something feminine.

00:21:56.441 --> 00:21:59.944
Woman and man. Yin and yang.

00:21:59.944 --> 00:22:01.780
When these extremities exist,

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:06.034
it maintains the order of
various things in nature.

00:22:06.034 --> 00:22:10.330
Humans, the earth, the stars
and the universe, too...

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:17.212
The Iron Sea is a system that extracts
energy from the earth of this planet.

00:22:17.212 --> 00:22:19.422
But it might've also been

00:22:19.422 --> 00:22:23.802
taking the planet's motherly
power away at the same time.

00:22:24.803 --> 00:22:31.101
If that's the case, the Iron Sea
is the cause of all the problems.

00:22:31.101 --> 00:22:36.356
Was my entire life... futile?

00:22:39.526 --> 00:22:42.737
Get ahold of yourself!
We were finally able to meet!

00:22:42.737 --> 00:22:44.614
Dad...

00:22:44.614 --> 00:22:46.116
Dad!

00:22:49.953 --> 00:22:51.746
It wasn't futile.

00:22:57.669 --> 00:22:59.170
Mom...

00:23:03.466 --> 00:23:05.552
Alicia!

00:23:05.552 --> 00:23:08.847
Your life cannot have been futile,

00:23:08.847 --> 00:23:12.392
because you brought Amata into this world.

00:23:12.392 --> 00:23:15.478
He'll connect the two worlds for sure.

00:23:18.606 --> 00:23:20.817
Amata...

00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:24.404
You are the proof of our love.

00:23:24.404 --> 00:23:25.739
Amata...

00:23:25.739 --> 00:23:32.203
Love her, too... Love the one
you treasure more than anyone.

00:23:34.873 --> 00:23:36.374
Mom!

00:23:38.209 --> 00:23:40.420
Mom!

00:24:23.254 --> 00:24:26.383
My damn woman of fate!

00:24:26.383 --> 00:24:30.595
I already know your true name.

00:24:30.595 --> 00:24:33.848
I love you! I love you, Silffy!

00:24:34.432 --> 00:24:37.270
"Next Episode 'Fragment of Adam'"
I want to pounce on you!
